  "description": "26\" Single Speed Women's Beach Cruiser Bike - Simplicity Meets Elegance\nThe Tracer Nova Complete Cruiser Bike for Women features a durable Hi-Ten steel frame and 26-inch wheels for smooth, stable rides. With a Shimano single-speed setup and fat tires, it’s perfect for easy cruising. Available in multiple colors, this hybrid bike offers both comfort and style. Whether you’re riding the beach or commuting around town, this beach cruiser bike for women ensures a fun and relaxed experience. Ideal for adult bike riders seeking a stylish, versatile bike.\n\nEASIER RIDING: The TRACER Nova beach cruiser is built for your comfort and relaxation. 26\"×2.125\" Inch Wheels, adult bicycle tires, enough to meet different kinds of rolling, whether a casual riding with families, friends, or for commuting use. You get to choose two-toned color options that suit your personality.\nSAFER RIDING: The Stunning Nova beach cruiser demonstrates some of the professional components like alloy seat post, coaster brakes, stainless steel spokes, 26’’X2.125” whitewall tires, and colored fenders.\nHIGH QUALITY: High-quality sealed ISO bottom bracket with Cr-Mo square axle and bearing shells of wrought iron, Hi-Ten Steel Frame, and Stainless Steel 14G Spokes.\nCOMFORT DESIGN: Wide cruiser bar, soft tower cruiser seat with a springer, fully stretch your body and arms, making the riding comfortable.\nEASY INSTALLATION: Fits riders from 5 feet to 6 feet 2 inches tall; comes 85 percent assembled.\n\nCOLORS\nBaby Blue, Black, Matte Black, Mint Green, Pink, Purple, White\n\nFRAME\nTracer Cruiser Hi-ten steel.\n\nFORK\nTracer 26\" Hi-ten steel.",
